title: 'a-clock: tray, notifications, duplicate, snooze toggle, puzzle-to-dismiss'
summary: 'Second feature batch for a-clock. Added a macOS menu-bar tray so closing the window hides it and the alarm scheduler keeps running, native notifications (plus auto-surfacing a hidden window) when an alarm fires, and one-click alarm duplication that drops the copy at the next free 15-minute slot. Made snooze toggleable per alarm, and added an optional ''solve to dismiss'' puzzle gate: 3-5 simple math problems (easy/medium/hard) that pause the alarm sound while solving, regenerate on a wrong answer, and resume ringing after a 60s stall. Gate is dismiss-only so snooze stays a one-tap escape.'
